id: pm-web-8pml
title: Certify pm-web against PM CLI/SDK 2026.9.26 and pm-changelog 2026.9.25
description: "Update PM CLI/SDK, pm-changelog, and pm-ops package and lockfile pins from 2026.9.23 to current registry releases, verify installed runtime versions, then rerun the complete release and packed npm/Bun acceptance gates. Keep the public package and private hosted deployment boundaries separate."
type: Chore
status: blocked
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-26T16:15:15.599Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-02T23:21:59.861Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "package.json and package-lock.json resolve @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.26, pm-changelog 2026.9.25, and pm-ops 2026.9.28; local node_modules reports the same versions; npm run release:check passes; PM strict health passes; the PR names both package PM items and no hosted data is added."
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T06:26:30.268Z",claude-hub,"2026-09-28: pinned pm-ops 2026.9.28 and re-copied its templates/prepare-merge-driver.ts (pm-ops#124: the omit-dev skip now checks every Node resolution path for an incomplete hoisted pm-ops, so a broken ancestor install fails instead of silently skipping the merge drivers). release:check and changelog:check pass on this branch."
  "2026-10-02T22:11:44.555Z",codex-sol,"Restart: current branch is already rebased on main; previous bot replies were inspected without repeating them. Greptile graph-export finding is an acknowledged security trade-off: GET/HEAD cannot run extension activation; pure export fidelity stays tracked in pm-web-38n5. Add a current graph regression receipt and run the unchanged full locked CI gate using PM_FLEET_ROOT. Existing coverage target and substantive reviews stay open; no Docker or hosted service changes."
  "2026-10-02T23:03:20.822Z",codex-sol,"Catalog fixes now yield 409/409 tests and unchanged configured coverage, but full gate fails production audit on transitive ip-address 10.5.0 via express-rate-limit ^10.2.0. GHSA-h3mg-xc3c-68pw affects <=10.7.0 and is patched >=10.7.1. Refresh only the transitive lockfile resolution within the existing range, retain all audit thresholds and SDK pins, reinstall reproducibly and rerun full locked gate. No hosted or telemetry/config changes."
  "2026-10-02T23:14:49.801Z",codex-sol,"Transitive lock refresh changed only ip-address 10.5.0 to 10.7.3; reproducible npm ci and production audit report zero vulnerabilities. Retry full gate was correctly refused by snapshot assertion because the new shell omitted required PM_FLEET_ROOT and scanned worktree inventory (408/409 tests). This is execution environment error, not a source/snapshot change: rerun unchanged full gate with explicit canonical fleet root. All assertions and prior failed receipts retained."
  "2026-10-02T23:21:58.634Z",codex-sol,"Final corrected-environment full gate passes: PM_FLEET_ROOT set to canonical fleet, locked release:check 409/409 tests, zero skips, 32-source coverage 84.39 lines / 80.48 branches / 77.82 functions, no independent statements metric. Doc/duplication gates, production audit zero vulnerabilities, real packed npm/Bun, changelog/date and attestation pass. ip-address lock-only 10.5.0 to 10.7.3 is the sole dependency delta, bounded malformed IPv6 rejection passes, and npm ci is reproducible. Accepted graph-fidelity tradeoff remains pm-web-38n5. Keep 100 percent coverage and substantive final-head review prerequisites open; no hosted deployment or user-data change. Release claim for orchestrator."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-26T16:23:28.535Z",codex,"2026-09-26: package runtime dependency and lock now exact-pin @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.26; dev tools pin pm-changelog 2026.9.25 and pm-ops 2026.9.26. Installed node_modules versions read back match. Extension manifest minimum host version is 2026.9.26. Copied the canonical pm-ops prepare launcher byte for byte after the first full gate correctly found drift. Focused real Git launcher tests passed 6/6, linked PM packaging/launcher test passed 1/1, and full npm run release:check passed including packed npm and Bun host versions 2026.9.26. pm-cli 2026.9.26 requires @sentry/node 10.75.1 transitively; the lockfile reflects that dependency while no telemetry source or configuration was changed. PR review, merge, hosted rollout, and 100% coverage remain separate gates."
